1
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:36,000
My Christmas Inn is a romance, tv movie film directed by Peter Sullivan.

2
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:06,000
With the holiday season in full swing, Jen Taylor is about to score a big
promotion at the San Francisco ad agency where she works.

3
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:36,000
But her life is unexpectedly turned upside down when she
inherits a cozy inn in Alaska from her aunt.

4
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:06,000
When she goes to inspect the property and meets handsome town attorney Steve
Anderson, she's surprised to find that nothing is what she expected.

5
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:36,000
The small town community is full of fun and festive Christmas traditions and soon, Jen starts
wondering if the inn might just be the place she belongs, and if Steve could be the Mr.

6
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:06,000
Right she has been waiting for.

7
00:38:30,000 --> 00:38:36,000
Jen Taylor, played by Tia Mowry.

8
00:44:00,000 --> 00:44:06,000
Susan Taylor, played by Jackée Harry.

9
00:49:30,000 --> 00:49:36,000
Perry Taylor, played by Tim Reid.

10
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
Molly Anderson, played by Erin Gray.

11
01:00:30,000 --> 01:00:36,000
Steve Anderson, played by Rob Mayes.

12
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
Christmas House Boy, played by Kai Findley.

13
01:11:30,000 --> 01:11:36,000
Snowed-Inn Christmas is a 2017 American-Canadian made-for-television romantic
comedy film directed by Gary Yates, from a screenplay by Carley Smale.

14
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:06,000
Starring Bethany Joy Lenz and Andrew Walker, it
premiered on 16 December 2017, on Lifetime.

15
01:22:30,000 --> 01:22:36,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
